    <button data-tool="line" title="Pen (L): click for a corner, click and drag for a smooth curve point;&#10;click the first point (or press Return) to close the outline.&#10;Shift keeps a side level, plumb or 45\xB0.&#10;Change it after with the Direct Selection tool (A), or drag a side's \u25C6 into an arc.">${ge.line}</button>
